// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Darrin_Wade 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Darrin Wade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3447991313" "Darrin Wade"
// ProfessionString :
"P4265154270" "Ex Midnighter"
// DescriptionString :
"P3007408013" "Darrin Wade was once a loyal member of the Midnight Squad, a secret organization dedicated to learning everything there is to know about the unknown. However, there was a  falling out and he left their organization. <br><br>He did not leave empty-handed, though, taking some of their more priceless relics and tomes. He's managed to establish himself in the Rogue Isles as a broker of lost information and ancient artifacts."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3760871527" "Can I help you?"
// HelloString :
"P2589366585" "Make it quick. We shouldn't be seen together."
// HelloString :
"P350012385" "Are you ready for this?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1208553963" "I don't know who you are. You better move on before I make that permanent."
// FirstVisitString :
"P92938406" "The first time with me, <color deepskyblue>Darrin Wade</color>, is always memorable.<br><br>I've seen things that would make a normal man curl up into the fetal position and rip his eyes out. I've walked on the backs of giants and drunk from the rivers of Avalon. <br><br>The simple man you see before you is only a single facet of my being."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3645978400" "I don't have anything more for you, maybe your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P76409112" "I have something you might be interested in, but it's classified beyond your current Threat Level. <color orange>Come back to me when you're level 20.</color>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P289474435" "I'm honored that you would speak with me, even though you are well out of my league. Now, unless you've come to improve my rep, I'd recommend moving along."
// IntroString :
"P1995053233" "There's a strange man by the name of Darrin Wade outside of the hospital. He claims to be an ex-member of the Midnight Squad. Now he deals in arcane lore and selling relics on the black market.<br><br>He's got a vendetta against the Midnighters, so if you're interested in going after them, he's your guy."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3040823876" "Meet with Darrin Wade"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2260092882" "All I've heard about this guy is that he talks a big game. As of yet, not one has been able to determine if his bite is worse than his bark."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P102040438" "There's someone you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3488351200" "There's a couple of people who you should talk to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


