// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Diviner_Maros 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Diviner Maros 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3553266623" "Diviner Maros"
// ProfessionString :
"P17031227" "Circle of Thorns Seer"
// DescriptionString :
"P779939680" "Diviner Maros is a figure of awe and terror, even among his fellow cultists within the Circle of Thorns. Though not the most powerful of their mystics, Maros has the ability or curse to see the past and future. Rumors say that his spirit was split across time after an accident during some arduous mystic research, but no one really knows the truth. Many within the Circle fear him, because his predictions come true all too often. When rumors arose that he was seeking freelancers to perform a tasks there was a great outcry within the Circle, but no one dared try to stop him."
// HelloString :
"P3930393379" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We meet again, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2892400254" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Tell me, how was... Oh, wait, that's right. You haven't done that yet.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P28818909" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It is good to see you, as it has been in future and will be in past.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3966928825" "Now is not the time, {VillainName}. I do not know you yet. If you wish this to change, there is one you must speak with: Crash Cage. Do her bidding, and I will know that our destinies are intertwined."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2131737446" "I am glad to meet you, {VillainName}. I have been savoring the completion of this moment for a long time. I am Diviner Maros, and I am a Seer. Past and future are to me a lattice-work of interconnected events, probabilities merging one to another, forming blossoms or reality where they connect. The talent is rare even among the Circle, and to use it with skill is rare still. For this reason, I am allowed some autonomy to associate as I choose. I will chose you, now, and offer you riches in Oranbegan gold to play a part in what I have foreseen."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P823994102" "We are done. The paths of our futures here diverge, but before you've gone, I would take one more minute of your time. I will not insult you with talk of destiny, but I will tell you that there are others who have sought to shape the future and your part in it. And you do have a part; many possible parts, in fact. You'll have to decide whether to chose a part, or have one be chosen for you. I have seen many of the roles, and many of the consequences. Choose wisely. <br><br>And we are done."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1138829910" "I do not need the power to see past and future to know that divided attention will lead only to ruin. Return to me when your other tasks are done."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2810606158" "I know of tasks that you will be able to do, but it is not yet time to reveal it to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2975489849" "We have passed a threshold now. All is as I will foresee. You will need powerful <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> to cope with your destiny. You must remain in contact with me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1128255504" "Time's cascade moves us forward, but there is much that you've done in time to come that you have not accomplished yet. Speak with me of what you <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>need,</a> and we can proceed."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3721034628" "We are now beyond the point of return. You must go forth, and I must do all I can to re-align this present to the future I once foresaw."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P95028796" "Diviner Maros is a member of the Circle of Thorns, but even the others in the Cult seem to be scared of him. Rumor is that he can see the past and the future, but no one is sure if it's true or not. What is known is that he's looking for freelancers to complete some special work for him, and that even though others in the Circle aren't happy with that, no one's made a move to stop him. Probably because they're afraid of what he knows. Maros has an endless supply of Magic and Mutant Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2068196116" "Choose Diviner Maros"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2600630609" "Maros says a lot of strange things. Don't let him get into your head."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1385403528" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone you've met in the near future</A> that you should be introduced to now."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3363825402" "There are <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>some people you could meet in the near future</A> that you should be introduced to now."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


