// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Doc_Buzzsaw 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Doc Buzzsaw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1791587215" "Doc Buzzsaw"
// ProfessionString :
"P18298936" "Freakshow Meat Doctor"
// DescriptionString :
"P3777535160" "Doc Buzzsaw makes no secret that she was once a disciple of Dr. Vahzilok, but had a falling out with her mentor some time ago. Afterwards she journeyed to the Rogue Isles to continue her research, and rumor has it, escape the retribution of the Vahzilok. The Freakshow came to her looking for someone who understood both cybernetic machinery and human anatomy well enough to repair them, and she quickly formed an association with them. The Freaks love the improvements  'Doc' makes for them, and Buzzsaw sees her energetic new allies as the perfect mix of protectors and test subjects. The fact that both sides are completely deranged only makes the partnership work better."
// HelloString :
"P89862758" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings, greetings, {VillainName}. A pleasure to see you as always.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1999094912" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Well hello, {VillainName}. Perhaps there's something you can help me with?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3653538615" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>How are you doing, {VillainName}? Well, I hope?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1731268906" "I am afraid that we have not been properly introduced. Unfortunately, I'm terribly busy at the moment. Perhaps another time, then?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P452064533" "Ah, you must be {VillainName}! I've heard so much about you. Please, call me Doctor Buzzsaw, or just 'Doc' if you prefer. My exuberant young friends within the Freakshow bequeathed the name to me following a small incident with my former fellows among the disciples of Dr. Vahzilok. Those times are behind me now, and so I chose to keep the colorful moniker to designate the start of my new life here, helping my allies. I hope that I will be able to count you amongst my associates as I continue my work. <br><br>So, without further ado, let us begin."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P49248435" "I'm afraid there's nothing else I need done, {VillainName}. It has been a delight to work with you, but there are no doubt other concerns pressing upon you. Go and attend them. I have much work of my own to do on my exuberant young friends."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3114319772" "I do not mean to be rude, {VillainName}, but you seem rather busy at the moment. Perhaps later, when you've accomplished your other tasks, I can provide you with another opportunity, hmm?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2684051541" "I have things that need to be done, but I fear you're not yet ready for them. Return once you've reached Threat Level {Level}, and perhaps we will speak then."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P1392919419" "My dear {VillainName}, I accept only a certain caliber of clientele. You will have to earn your way into my good graces."
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P996154862" "You've earned scarcely any Infamy! I will not deal with you!"
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P3569249277" "You have begun to earn more Infamy, but I still am not ready to accept you."
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P269444422" "I must admit, you have earned a good deal of Infamy since last we spoke. Earn a little bit more, and perhaps we can bring a new level to our relationship."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P308589008" "You have done quite well. It was quite a stroke of luck that we came into association. You will find items most wondrous in my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store.</a> Call me any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1335730300" "You've proven quite dependable, {VillainName}. I must say I've forgotten how nice it can be to have someone whose work I can count on. Please, look at my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store.</a> I insist."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3393878105" "I'm terribly sorry, {VillainName}, but I fear that I have nothing left that might prove a challenge to one of your ability."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1239036703" "Doc Buzzsaw works with the Freakshow. She helps them out with repairs, cybernetic implants, and surgery. In return, the Freaks protect her and serve as test subjects for her work. Buzzsaw is always looking for someone to get jobs done. As long as you aren't squeamish, she should have some work. Buzzsaw can get you Technology and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1846811153" "Choose Doc Buzzsaw"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P479149141" "Doc's a little unhinged, but she always pays on a contract."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P673758308" "There are <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>several individuals</A> I know who would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


