// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Operative Kirkland 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2496012982" "Operative Kirkland"
// ProfessionString :
"P871174980" "Arachnos Operative"
// DescriptionString :
"P2008493247" "Arachnos Operative Kirkland keeps tabs on the various villainous factions on Sharkhead Isle, making sure that no one group gains too much power or overly disrupts the day-to-day activities that keep the area functional."
// HelloString :
"P1254407087" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>{VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2106387020" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to do your part for Arachnos?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2249102446" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Arachnos requires your talents, {VillainName}.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3845961153" "You're not authorized to speak with me. Speak to Operative Vargas first."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1724725208" "Ah, you must be {VillainName}. I've read your profile, and think you might be of service to Arachnos. I am Operative Kirkland. I'm a field agent for Arachnos, keeping tabs on the who's and the what's of Sharkhead Isle. Play your cards right and you may one day earn a position of prestige within Arachnos. Disappoint us at your peril."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1896475883" "Well, that makes a clean sweep of this area. Arachnos appreciates your assistance."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1831554686" "You're currently involved in other matters. Arachnos requires focus from its operatives, so take clear up your other business first."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3292861176" "I'm sorry, {VillainName}, but your Threat Level is... ineffective. Come back when you've achieved Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2605994172" "You're starting to prove your worth to Arachnos, {VillainName}. As a reward, I will offer you greater access to my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store,</a> as well as my communication codes. Don't abuse them."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P175418075" "Arachnos is pleased with your results, {VillainName}. You may buy any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> you desire."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1383571650" "You've surpassed our expectations, {VillainName}. Thank you for your service to Arachnos!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1882922318" "Operative Kirkland keeps tabs on the various factions on Sharkhead Isle, and looks for freelancers willing to do service for Arachnos. Arachnos keeps him supplied with plenty of Natural and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4184498539" "Choose Operative Kirkland"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4218342740" "Operative Kirkland is an efficient and loyal member of Arachnos. Do good work for him and he can assure you patronage from the Arachnos elite down the line."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3061933938" "I have <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3775679004" "I have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associates</a> you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

